  "description": "***All bills are included in the rent to make it a seamless and transparent experience.***\r\n\r\nEquipped with kitchenette and ensuite, this pad also comes with a private built-in desk space.\r\n\r\nDevelopment Description\r\n\r\nImagine a lifestyle where everything is taken care of. \r\nLocated right in the vibrant heart of Rathmines, this innovative co-living community offers an unparalleled living experience.\r\n\r\nAll-Inclusive Living - No Hidden Costs! Simplify your life with a single payment that covers all your essentials:\r\n•\tHeating\r\n•\tElectricity\r\n•\tHigh-Speed WIFI\r\n•\tWater & Refuse\r\n•\tGym\r\n\r\nPremium Development Amenities: This isn't just an apartment—it's a complete lifestyle. \r\nEnjoy exclusive access to incredible facilities designed for modern living:\r\n\r\n•\tFREE Gym Access (Classes Included!)\r\n•\tStunning Rooftop Terrace with Panoramic City Views\r\n•\tProfessional Co-Working Spaces\r\n•\t24/7 Concierge & Security (CCTV)\r\n•\tGames Room, and On-Site Café\r\n•\tExtensive Social Events Calendar – 20 Events per month\r\n•\tSecure Bicycle Parking\r\n\r\nThe Studio: Your private, stylish studio is fully equipped with a modern kitchenette and a private ensuite bathroom. Designed for comfort and productivity, it also features a dedicated built-in desk space.\r\n\r\n\r\nUnbeatable Location & Connectivity: Join this exclusive community in one of Dublin City's trendiest neighbourhoods. Rathmines offers everything you need right on your doorstep, including supermarkets, trendy cafés, award-winning restaurants, popular bars, a cinema, and a library. You're within easy walking distance to the City Centre and benefit from excellent transport links (Luas, multiple bus routes, Dublin Bike and GoCar).\r\n\r\nReady to elevate your living experience? We can't wait to welcome you to the Rathmines House community.\r\nPlease Note: The photographs shown are examples. We offer a variety of unit layouts and orientations, priced according to type. Contact us today for details on available units!",
